{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_title", "source_sha256": "6bf5339ff61ed40ab6bc4c02503964283e44e0100e9f38f4df75662fc4aa2211", "ja": "問題！　自分らしさとは？", "zh": "提问！何谓自己的风格？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dd2a43e073266a5df4d95113e8d8c4eee819af4afd136424b657a22e576890fe", "ja": "定期公演で新曲のお披露目をする事になった\nのり子に、何か目標を決めてみたらどうだ？　\nと語るプロデューサー。クイズ番組の出演や\n新曲の公演を経て、のり子は自分なりの目標\nを決めるのだった。", "zh": "要在定期公演上公开新歌的法子，\n制作人对她说要不要定一个目标？\n在经历猜谜节目的演出和新歌公演后，\n法子定下了属于自己的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c821ce2914c86d377e3f884e9d70ae3f4b68fdfac16349b97290463e766389c9", "ja": "（今日から、定期公演のレッスンが始まった。\nこの打ち合わせが終わったら、急いで皆と合流しよう）", "zh": "（定期公演的排练从今天开始了。等这次商谈结束后，得赶紧去和大家会合）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "a3b48385d6c371e5a4f367b83463246c6b49f642a35b65d11516120b8386a177", "ja": "それでは、次の問題です。\n『外は人、中は熊。さて、何の食べ物でしょう』……。", "zh": "那么，下面是下一道题。\n“外面是人，里面是熊。那么，这是什么食物呢？”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "04bf962f7100d56a4d36c4ce2c3e6accbf254f392f56c13a9228931ecca838f1", "ja": "はいっ！\n答えは……『肉まん』です。", "zh": "是！\n答案是……“肉包子”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "8197a3edd05fad341c292edb1b3d534041b13d2d4c8310f259ad7fe087f54e92", "ja": "ピンポーン♪　正解だよ、瑞希ちゃん！\nすごい、これで10問連続……！", "zh": "叮咚♪答对啦，瑞希！\n好厉害，这样就连续答对10道题了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "e18feddb3bc30690263dabb9160166a4e2def7efa77e605546c8598e921c2218", "ja": "ええーっ！？　な、なんで肉まんが正解なの？\nていうか、人と熊で食べ物って何っ！？", "zh": "诶诶——！？ 为、为什么肉包会是正确答案啊？\n话说，人和熊能组成什么食物啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "e86ded115362b35d69cda499232bf7039cdd3bee7de8cb514caa93908c228317", "ja": "それでは、私が解説しましょう。……コホン。\nまずは『肉まん』を、ひらがなにします。すると……。", "zh": "那么，就由我来讲解吧。……咳咳。\n首先，把“肉包”写成平假名。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "11eacf53dffcbc2e9bf1296ab64b69ccc85bc2ad07225f8c42ebc244799a96f8", "ja": "『にくまん』の外側は、『に』と『ん』です。\nそして内側には、『くま』が現れました。ガオー。", "zh": "“にくまん”的外侧，是“に”和“ん”。\n而内侧则出现了“くま”。嗷呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "3fedc8510c01d6b5de40da5d4cfa6a6d09d02e1939a1c72884129b27a733a850", "ja": "クイズというより、なぞなぞ……かしら？\nいろんな問題が出るのね。", "zh": "与其说是问答，不如说是猜谜……吧？\n会出现各种各样的问题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "63779c5bb5ea66598490947287632cb08ad232962e8306fb098a9b34e931bd5f", "ja": "くぅっ……何回やっても、瑞希に勝てないー！\nこれじゃ、勝負にならないよー！", "zh": "唔……不管试多少次，都赢不了瑞希——！\n这样根本算不上比赛啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "2ccc78cae5501e87a37a57a15948e310755a93e386cdc9290a7baf1a2b36356b", "ja": "なら、次は私と勝負よ、瑞希ちゃん！\nウフフ、なんだか燃えてきちゃった♪", "zh": "那么，接下来和我比一场吧，小瑞希！\n呵呵，感觉越来越有干劲了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "845d1cde1a462be263dce15e8d6433d02c00b0320fb2ccd1a0bf79a0dfb4c24d", "ja": "あれ？　でも莉緒さんとあずささんは、\n別のコーナーに出る事になったんじゃ……。", "zh": "哎？可是莉绪小姐和梓小姐，\n不是要去参加别的环节了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "df701dbee7bcef2350190e41466def7c44dca36f9f42a168af71ae205034395e", "ja": "ええ。私たちは、フィットネスチャレンジの\nコーナーになったの。でも……。", "zh": "是的。我们被安排参加健身挑战环节了。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "c5da88e934a2827126ecd67303431fe211ee1ae03e7dce0ffdf82fb99a55d37e", "ja": "クイズの練習を、ただ見てるだけなんて、\nつまらないじゃない？", "zh": "光看着别人练习猜谜，未免太无聊了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "361cfd82ee47e5eae3d735a4c90079a24f0839d33f719759485aee450d9c5451", "ja": "そのとおりです、百瀬さん。\n私は、誰の挑戦でも受けて立ちます。……かもん。", "zh": "正是如此，百濑小姐。  \n无论是谁的挑战，我都会接下。……来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "632fc699a193751f2586e0a8d62d97d4b70a64e9f4eeca403baa5b73a31141cf", "ja": "言ったわね、瑞希ちゃん！　のり子ちゃん、交代よ！\nお姉さんだって、負けないわよー！", "zh": "你说了算，瑞希！诺里子，换我上！\n姐姐可不会输给你哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "81025d5beba4d72e2d4d5f900dc2e7e4acf79a3b8b299ddda033fff083064067", "ja": "あはっ！　なんか、タッグ戦みたいだね？\nそれじゃ、後はまかせたよ莉緒姉！　雪辱を果たして！", "zh": "啊哈！感觉像是在打双打比赛呢？\n那接下来就交给你啦，莉绪姐！一定要雪耻哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "fca9016a4ddc59f1d866ca2ef621a2107557607efd95170c976e5bb2e0dd5da5", "ja": "ふふっ。それじゃあ私は、\n読み手のお手伝いでもしようかしら？", "zh": "呵呵，那我来帮忙读吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1018_p", "source_sha256": "095eb0fcce5fbcf8d3af924b443bac545ad05a83af9799add6f7581c9eebf3c7", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま……ん？", "zh": "大家辛苦了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "2c0cb5ebaecedbfa1d45c2dcb3bc546cd0c8afe2767d6ca7e366236e0123adcf", "ja": "はい！\n……答えは、『シャンパーニュ地方』です。", "zh": "是！\n……答案是“香槟地区”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1020_010azu", "source_sha256": "b30cdacdea2b5006175a3a10b4adb16dede2f9c8a1c9bc5b9057717b18da635f", "ja": "まあ、また正解。\n瑞希ちゃん、本当にクイズに強いのね～。", "zh": "哎呀，又答对了。\n瑞希真的很擅长猜谜呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "ba3fa753a47c01673709b2f0af45e9de689aa8eefcae47a54561a22d7aeffc05", "ja": "ああん、今の問題は、絶対答えられたのに～！\n悔しい！", "zh": "啊啊，刚才那道题我明明绝对能答出来的～！\n好不甘心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1022_p", "source_sha256": "707577708623667e517d23096259af55cb18707296a4891521b82a55aff5f7d0", "ja": "のり子、春香。\n……みんな、何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "典子、春香。  \n……大家在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "177da14ec14b96587cda6feb5051633bfa91444778d3d9bb980725d51a60608b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}、お疲れ！\n実はちょっと、クイズの特訓をね……えへへ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n其实我们正在进行一点猜谜特训……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1024_001har", "source_sha256": "321227c4f3adff43a4fe077245d829b017451428f9c17a7c092327794aea2153", "ja": "最初はのり子ちゃんと瑞希ちゃんだったんですけど、\n白熱してきちゃって。", "zh": "一开始是乃里子和瑞希，\n结果越来越激烈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1025_p", "source_sha256": "130f856afc846da4cde84ae3eae7ad21d661b4780d293b9d3e60cb840ddc8fea", "ja": "レッスンにしては盛り上がってるなと思ったけど、\nそうか。まさかクイズの練習とはな……。", "zh": "我还以为只是练习，没想到气氛这么热烈。\n原来如此，没想到居然是在练习答题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "31bdb35a16ce8f56048212ad2fae5bb234e58158093542bad73242b1dbe1031d", "ja": "ご、ごめんね、{$P$}。春香も。\n初日のレッスンが、こんなことになっちゃって……。", "zh": "对、对不起，{$P$}。还有春香。\n第一天的训练居然变成这样了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1027_001har", "source_sha256": "1f90097adf8a80ac16f0f77baec32a15278b8127ad8a9174f413a2e451e2e921", "ja": "気にしなくても大丈夫だよ、のり子ちゃん。\n初日はいつも、ミーティングがメインだし……。", "zh": "不用在意，没关系的，法子。\n第一天本来就是以开会为主……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1028_001har", "source_sha256": "956bc8d236d8e2a54eba561e027250c3cd19c4f7f4a3aeb15d10b3b5cb9405b9", "ja": "公演までは、まだまだ時間もあるから！\nクイズの練習もレッスンも、がんばろうね♪", "zh": "距离公演还有很多时间呢！\n猜谜练习和课程，我们都加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1029_043nor", "source_sha256": "33626abd11b6febc842cd1ef78bf57cb030022e6f0306917c06fd3ac6e4d58c5", "ja": "うんっ！　……えへっ、よかったー。\nレッスンが一番大事なのは、わかってるんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯！……嘿嘿，太好了——\n我知道练习才是最重要的，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "d828d7624c16e8a55115ed03b2f038a8668394deb922433603ac20ba065cd92c", "ja": "せっかくこのメンバーで、テレビにも出るんだし。\nみんなで、目いっぱい練習しておきたかったんだ！", "zh": "难得有机会和大家一起上电视，我本来想和大家一起尽情练习的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "b13c03bf7abf03953575553da339a98ec4e3082be98cc2496eddf01ee8187208", "ja": "そのほうが、こう……なんていうのかな。\n団結力が上がる、みたいな？", "zh": "那样的话，怎么说呢……感觉能提升大家的团结力之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a79dfcda5624f2f8f38bfb2968a277c357b3bcd886592af75a1eb0e114c5e632", "ja": "なるほど。のり子は公演を成功させるために、\nそんな事を考えてたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。为了让公演成功，诺莉子一直在考虑这些事情啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "e3706e2d0f51c96effd8d79120f432e9ed15f3824714281a11bd4de6b4301e02", "ja": "のり子ちゃん。私、のり子ちゃんとは\nリコッタでも一緒だったけど……。", "zh": "典子。我虽然和典子一起参加过里科塔，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1034_001har", "source_sha256": "179c7f415462b1ef833ef77160d470923b648c7cbabe6c818217ed118302e3b7", "ja": "今回の公演、今まで以上にみんなとも\n仲良くなれそうで、うれしいな。ありがとう♪", "zh": "这次的公演，感觉能比以前和大家变得更加要好了，我很开心。谢谢你们♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "59689b188d54224f8fbc11cc308cea400bbc679cabe74d3ba796cf9a44546b74", "ja": "そ、そんな！　アタシが何かしたわけじゃないし、\nお礼を言われるようなことじゃないよ！", "zh": "没、没什么！我又没做什么，也不值得你道谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "86e5e8d24d881c1a1ab91bdeb446bb55e37ec4940c745cdc3e86f872f9e86650", "ja": "ただ、いろんなユニット活動とかしてきて、\nこのほうがいいんじゃないかなって思っただけで……。", "zh": "只是参加过各种组合活动后，觉得这样或许更好……而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0d986ae90fbd803e9eb1e0717bab60ab8763881c025096a4e533a722d90b7f68", "ja": "そうか。成長してるな、のり子！", "zh": "这样啊。你成长了不少嘛，法子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "d1f5eef158d9cfa2f4ba7064b15d781d2cf46eae6b5d58851fcf473881f11a91", "ja": "へっ！？\n成長って……アタシが？", "zh": "咦！？\n成长……我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1039_p", "source_sha256": "10e8da071473d572985aeef2314ed75d03fe2474f5ccca6439849c002386c246", "ja": "ああ。そうやって周りのことを見て動けるのは、\nのり子が成長してる証拠だと思うよ。", "zh": "对。能像这样观察周围的情况并采取行动，我觉得就是你成长的证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "c5c7a25959ef1f5ef9d636072b4299bb4b73a5618be076021d09a583b46dc593", "ja": "そうなんだ……。なんか、自分では全然、\n考えたこともなかったよ。ね、ねえ、春香？", "zh": "这样啊……我自己完全没想过这些。对、对了，春香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1041_001har", "source_sha256": "e74ac68088f11f86c7269322e21479ecf21e4257b4e5accec3964395c235030f", "ja": "私は、のり子ちゃんらしいなって思うけど……。\nいいところって、自分じゃ気づかないのかも？", "zh": "我觉得这很像纪子的风格……\n自己的优点，说不定自己是察觉不到的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1042_043nor", "source_sha256": "1cc59914fad9332ffb415aa96d8ed9bb5a9a621b9e62d0e4bed870b8bf90062d", "ja": "春香まで、やめてよ～、もう……\nうう、照れる……。", "zh": "春香你也是，别这样啦～，真的……\n呜呜，好害羞……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1043_p", "source_sha256": "0eb93e9b5f74f7a43e2bf6a61d419c1094bc1f62dafc2ad0c9ff7490fc1d3f44", "ja": "そうだ、のり子。\n目標は決まったのか？", "zh": "对了，法子。目标定下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1044_043nor", "source_sha256": "28df47aef6280cddf73d8dd4d2019151739605b7a74a4f8afa8ee7c12a2243a8", "ja": "あっ、それ！　ずーっと考えてるんだけど、\nいまいち「これ！」っていうのが浮かばなくて……。", "zh": "啊，对了！我一直在想这件事，可就是没能想到一个“就是这个！”的目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1045_043nor", "source_sha256": "d9150b4c06c32e492db5ef77bddd43d81b13475212432ca18ec2d4192fdc77b9", "ja": "もちろん、『THE☆アイドルショー』の仕事は\nちゃんとやるよ！　せっかくテレビに出るんだし……。", "zh": "当然，《THE☆偶像秀》的工作我会好好完成的！毕竟难得能上电视嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "e053dd8979cda975152ea19d420911b16dea0750af0c73993c2117899b9ca817", "ja": "瑞希が765プロのクイズ女王なら、アタシは\n挑戦者として全力でチャンピオンに挑まないと！って。", "zh": "如果瑞希是765届的答题女王，那我作为挑战者，就得全力向冠军发起挑战才行！ ҡар", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1047_001har", "source_sha256": "e959b7fa08d3e9bc793a493d1aa7a43b46e69a525eaeced463d55046a60e7385", "ja": "ふふっ。\nのり子ちゃんは、何にでも一生懸命だね！", "zh": "呵呵。\n纪子真是对什么都那么认真呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1048_043nor", "source_sha256": "a899df593821760d3f4e7bd9996a497b79a648af8b986f2079d9ed2ed67662df", "ja": "うん！　……って。\nもしかしてアタシって、大人げない……！？", "zh": "嗯！……不对。难道我这样是不是太不成熟了……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1049_001har", "source_sha256": "4846e7c2530e35bfced2230945e139874b4ca413a7c6c916b25376684cb2fe4a", "ja": "ううん、そんなことないと思う。\nですよね、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "不会，我觉得没那回事。\n对吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1050_p", "source_sha256": "c8b6ad3449ac1a71cdb348891632c57f73e48758c3f06212f6be31708713706d", "ja": "ああ。そうやって何事にも全力で取り組むところが、\nのり子らしさなのかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。无论做什么都全力以赴，或许正是典子的一贯风格吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1051_043nor", "source_sha256": "a723b6380080cb623287fb2933921796eea722407961801e73b74bcdb0d3aa77", "ja": "アタシらしさ……。", "zh": "这就是我自己的风格……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1052_p", "source_sha256": "e819fa62af2537a221a1c6872448d04d59af4ca98807d414686ccbc44a8f60ba", "ja": "仲間思いな部分も、勝負に熱くなるところも。\n自分で気づいていない全部が、のり子の魅力なんだよ。", "zh": "体贴伙伴的一面，还有在比赛中热血沸腾的样子。就连你自己都没注意到的这一切，都是典子的魅力啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1053_043nor", "source_sha256": "09edc3d6f3f0e9bdafff4c08952c3b6363e93cf2f804488932f811238013873c", "ja": "あ、ありがと……。でも、面と向かって\n魅力なんて言われると、なんか、照れるね……えへへ。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……不过，被人当面说有魅力什么的，总觉得有点害羞呢……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1054_010azu", "source_sha256": "27df5e786aafd680352b6447ae193a5047b2a05ca27361e28f31154a0312926f", "ja": "のり子ちゃん、春香ちゃん。\nそろそろレッスンを始めましょうか？", "zh": "则子，春香。差不多该开始训练了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1055_043nor", "source_sha256": "561db781f75abc3b693fc7db4cdb0a9b26c5cf4b27dd6a620328aee8d7766225", "ja": "レッスン……ああっ！？　も、もうこんな時間！？", "zh": "训练……啊！？已、已经这么晚了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1056_p", "source_sha256": "eb5734b4cbca11a33e91553119b553035069a36bb8278331e27e66dc4237f582", "ja": "頑張れよ、ふたりとも！", "zh": "加油啊，你们两个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1057_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1058_p", "source_sha256": "cb4376d5d2738b2b8b9f6a6e0477c5b4d024384a8c5b25519440780c2d3dc6ee", "ja": "（『THE☆アイドルショー』の収録が終わった。\nクイズは白熱した対決の末、瑞希が勝利した……！）", "zh": "（《THE☆偶像秀》的录制结束了。\n竞猜经过一番白热化的对决，最终瑞希获胜了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1059_null", "source_sha256": "6f1906a0b6c0c7647f456ab81bb5561e26ff1cea064cd5b2a52edc1f84ecc50f", "ja": "―放送当日―", "zh": "―播出当天―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1060_043nor", "source_sha256": "f18a39512e9112de9090aa409b5c8692db5f7fc30233f97ea661c3325015546e", "ja": "はあ～……。", "zh": "唉～～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1062_p", "source_sha256": "1b3b8dc2934ef3a8c8660e82faa77b768070d9870ef9de81676597ba64d42008", "ja": "何を、そんなに落ち込んでるんだ？\nのり子も瑞希も、最後まで良い戦いだったじゃないか！", "zh": "你这是怎么了，为什么这么沮丧？\n则子和瑞希不是都奋战到最后了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1063_043nor", "source_sha256": "da9941dd585154f3964fcf43ac877d7392897d335216f26a90204723844849c4", "ja": "それは、そうなんだけど……ねえ、瑞希？", "zh": "话是这么说没错……对吧，瑞希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1064_044miz", "source_sha256": "aaad477f33e509b435c5ebb146b79caa26c5eceded5215a6ab7b5130b05ed573", "ja": "はい。私は、クイズに勝利しました。\nですが、とても複雑です。……チラッ。", "zh": "是的。我赢得了猜谜游戏。\n但是，心情非常复杂。……偷偷瞄一眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1065_001har", "source_sha256": "458c09de8fc9d3e83c41ba5676b8f1cc9733db351853b6d16ee5907991fc610e", "ja": "えっ？　……わ、私？", "zh": "咦？……我、我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1066_043nor", "source_sha256": "43a7e978592289f3f7ad067c30d0916b177a97784ecea793809da4a82bbfd4a9", "ja": "たしかに、アタシと瑞希の勝負は白熱してたよ？\nでも……。", "zh": "确实，我和瑞希的比赛很激烈哦？\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1067_044miz", "source_sha256": "4594658c36571867a4592f311f7d0ae05bfc1a6ef38b4fb6b78f89706bcecf28", "ja": "はい。私達の勝負より、天海さんのほうが、\n印象に残りました。……うらやましいぞ。", "zh": "是的。比起我们的对决，天海小姐那边更让人印象深刻……真让人羡慕啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1068_p", "source_sha256": "a740b879f9dd06e89fd5f8e238497b3e8ea4b73feaded45040ca8dab31f72c1c", "ja": "そこは、バラエティ番組だからな。バッチリ\n美味しいところを持っていくとは、流石だぞ、春香！", "zh": "毕竟这是综艺节目嘛。能把最精彩的部分稳稳拿走，不愧是春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1069_001har", "source_sha256": "936b49cba776ae033ed2255227bb4d5620c3ac32d9ef12d7bed9ea6fe3343608", "ja": "ご、誤解ですよ！？　ふたりが悩んでたみたいだから、\n私が時間を作らないとって思って、それで……。", "zh": "误、误会啊！？因为看起来你们两个好像正在烦恼，我就想着得给你们争取点时间，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1070_p", "source_sha256": "1f1c4ee7ec3871b3f73a92911aa756e3b2c4661c33aa149398ce79af3120c5e8", "ja": "時間稼ぎにボタンを押したのはいいけど、\n答えがわからなくて、爆笑されたと……。", "zh": "为了拖延时间按了按钮，结果答不上来，被人笑得前仰后合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1071_001har", "source_sha256": "879bcbff068b4a0247fe8dea3520d43cff5aed90385365634908e1cd498abf4f", "ja": "うう……は、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "呜呜……好、好难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
