{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1074_043nor", "source_sha256": "8b57974b1b1964b3a16834e660b102a3e0a2b81840d4b4a3219d5b80a0cae551", "ja": "くーっ！　次こそは、アタシのほうが目立ってやる！\n相手が仲間でも、絶対に手加減しないっ！", "zh": "呜——！下次我一定要让自己更引人注目！\n就算对手是同伴，也绝对不会手下留情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1075_043nor", "source_sha256": "852900a6065610fde1872fdd5389b3419896c380099e4eae38e1c0fe7460db4d", "ja": "そのためにも、まずは……\n新曲のお披露目公演を、成功させないとね！", "zh": "为此，首先要……\n让新歌的首演公演取得成功才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
