{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1077_044miz", "source_sha256": "67e53b4f5b787e7871f699a46e8cf0fc319bba68f59b0d80a4911bc59694e3ac", "ja": "では、私も。\n福田さんに、遅れをとるわけにはいきません。", "zh": "那么，我也来。\n可不能被福田小姐落下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1078_043nor", "source_sha256": "00177a022b0993d715b68679f83c1a5840d1676863e0a4d175f348195212aa2c", "ja": "よしっ、行こう瑞希！　でも、ふたりには悪いけど、\n定期公演ではアタシが一番目立ってみせるからね！", "zh": "好，走吧，瑞希！不过先跟你们两个说声抱歉，定期公演上我一定会成为最引人注目的那个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_073_1079_043nor", "source_sha256": "199337089b3174d08f530fbc9dbfd1b824a05fda53708a7999a018ce7ade73d2", "ja": "何といっても、アタシの曲のお披露目だし！\n得意なことで負けるわけには行かない、ってね♪", "zh": "毕竟这是我的歌曲首次亮相嘛！  \n在自己擅长的领域可不能输给别人，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
